§ `Article 23(7): cooperation with the relevant competent authorities`

-- src:459 | 7. Importers shall cooperate with the relevant competent authorities in any action those authorities take in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importers, in particular to reduce and mitigate the risks posed by it.
@ref Art 23(7) (src:459)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the importer has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities in that action` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 23(7) the importer has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importer`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in any action those authorities take in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importers" (no such action)
        ELSE
             IF `the importer has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities in that action`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Importers shall cooperate with the relevant competent authorities in any action those authorities take in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importers, in particular to reduce and mitigate the risks posed by it"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 23, "", 0)

@ref Art 23(7) (src:459)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 23 act`
`Art 23(7) the importer's duty to cooperate with the relevant competent authorities` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system placed on the market by the importer`
    THEN PARTY Importer
         MUST `Art 23(7) cooperate with the relevant competent authorities`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Importer BECAUSE "the importer did not cooperate with the relevant competent authorities"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the authorities have taken no action
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 23, "", 0)

